/**
 * \mainpage StMtdHitMaker — Maker that converts raw MTD data into StMtdCollection
 *
 * \section mtd_purpose Purpose
 * StMtdHitMaker reads raw Muon Telescope Detector (MTD) sub-events from the
 * STAR DAQ stream via the RTS reader.  It unpacks TDC leading- and
 * trailing-edge words per THUB fiber and backleg module, applies INL
 * corrections, matches single-sided timing measurements into two-sided
 * \c StMtdHit objects using trigger-time-window selection, and stores the
 * results in \c StMtdCollection inside \c StEvent.
 *
 * \section mtd_input Input
 * - Raw MTD DAQ sub-event from the RTS reader.
 * - INL correction tables (\c StBTofINLCorr) and tray / TDIG geometry maps
 *   from the STAR database, loaded in \c InitRun().
 * - Optional: trigger time-window cut file for cosmic-ray or special runs.
 *
 * \section mtd_output Output
 * - \b StMtdCollection inside StEvent, containing:
 *   - \c StMtdRawHit — un-corrected TDC words with hardware address.
 *   - \c StMtdHit    — matched two-sided hits with backleg/tray/channel
 *     and leading/trailing times [ps].
 *
 * \section mtd_classes Key Classes
 * | Class | Role |
 * |-------|------|
 * | StMtdHitMaker | Main maker; orchestrates unpacking and hit matching |
 * | StMtdRawHit | Raw single-sided TDC hit |
 * | StMtdHit | Matched two-sided MTD hit |
 * | StMtdCollection | StEvent container for all MTD data |
 * | StBTofINLCorr | TDC Integral Non-Linearity correction (shared with BTOF) |
 *
 * \section mtd_usage Usage Example
 * \code{.cpp}
 * StMtdHitMaker* mtdHit = new StMtdHitMaker("mtd_raw");
 * // For Run 13 data (first half of run):
 * mtdHit->setSwapBacklegInRun13(1);
 * chain->AddMaker(mtdHit);
 * \endcode
 *
 * \note Run-specific corrections must be applied via setter methods before
 *       \c Init() is called: backleg swap (Run 13), strip reversal (Run 14).
 */
